---
// Conteúdo da seção "Supported Networks"
---

<section class="py-20">
  <div class="text-center">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold uppercase">One Hub, All Your Networks</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-lg text-foreground/70">
      Connect to the platforms that matter most to your audience.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-background/30 p-6 text-center font-mono text-lg"
    >
      LinkedIn
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-background/30 p-6 text-center font-mono text-lg"
    >
      Twitter / X
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-background/30 p-6 text-center font-mono text-lg"
    >
      Instagram
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-background/30 p-6 text-center font-mono text-lg"
    >
      Threads
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-background/30 p-6 text-center font-mono text-lg"
    >
      Facebook
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-background/30 p-6 text-center font-mono text-lg"
    >
      Discord
    </div>
    <div
      class="rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-background/30 p-6 text-center font-mono text-lg"
    >
      Telegram
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
